<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to import 76 mln bbls crude oil in March.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to import 76 mln bbls crude oil in March.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean oil refiners plan to import 76 million barrels of crude oil this month against an estimated 73 million barrels last month, a ministry official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
